  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-gold pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energy Assimilation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Father_%28Fullmetal_Alchemist%29_sun_palm.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111007013845\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Father (Fullmetal Alchemist) sun palm\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Father_%28Fullmetal_Alchemist%29_sun_palm.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20111007013845\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Father_%28Fullmetal_Alchemist%29_sun_palm.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20111007013845 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Father_%28Fullmetal_Alchemist%29_sun_palm.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20111007013845 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Father (Fullmetal Alchemist) sun palm\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Father_%28Fullmetal_Alchemist%29_sun_palm.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Father (Fullmetal Alchemist) sun palm.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Father (Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood) was able to absorb people in to his body.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Transmute matter into energy and absorb it.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"It takes a colossal amount of energy to <a href=\"/wiki/Deity_Consumption\" title=\"Deity Consumption\">contain God</a> within me. The people of this country were converted into energy for this purpose. And now... both God and his people reside within me.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Father (Fullmetal Alchemist)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>transmute all forms of matter into pure energy and then absorb it</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mass-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Mass-Energy Manipulation\">Mass-Energy Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transmutation\" title=\"Energy Transmutation\">Energy Transmutation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can transmute any form of <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">matter</a>, organic or inorganic, into <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">energy which they can absorb</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">manipulate</a> in several ways. Since the conversion of mass to energy is E= MC^2 (Energy = Mass multiplied by the speed of light raised to the power of 2), the user gains a colossal amount of power by absorbing and manipulating it, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Projection\" title=\"Energy Projection\">expelling</a> the energy <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Energy Attacks\">offensively</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Defense\" title=\"Energy Defense\">defensively</a>, use it to <a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">enhance</a> their physical condition or even <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transduction\" title=\"Energy Transduction\">transduce</a> the energy back into matter. Due to being converted into energy, the user can transduce the energy in any (physical) <a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Matter_Transmutation\" title=\"Meta Matter Transmutation\">matter</a> that the user desires. Even if the user’s energy level is low, something as simple as inhaling the air around them can fuel the user with the energy equivalent to a nuclear fission bomb, effectively turning the user into a constantly active nuclear fission reactor. The actual method of converting matter into energy can either by using <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Equivalence\" title=\"Personal Equivalence\">one’s own energy</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Equivalence\" title=\"Energetic Equivalence\">external energy</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Projection\" title=\"Energy Projection\">Energy Projection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Energy Attacks\">Energy Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Exoskeleton\" title=\"Energy Exoskeleton\">Energy Exoskeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Infusion\" title=\"Energy Infusion\">Energy Infusion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Constructs\" title=\"Energy Constructs\">Energy Constructs</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Propulsion\" title=\"Energy Propulsion\">Energy Propulsion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transduction\" title=\"Energy Transduction\">Energy Transduction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Channeling\" title=\"Energy Channeling\">Energy Channeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Source_Selection\" title=\"Energy Source Selection\">Energy Source Selection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transmogrification\" title=\"Energy Transmogrification\">Energy Transmogrification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Creation\" title=\"Matter Creation\">Matter Creation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transferal\" title=\"Energy Transferal\">Energy Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Transmutation\" title=\"Energy Transmutation\">Energy Transmutation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fundamental_Power_Link\" title=\"Fundamental Power Link\">Fundamental Power Link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Matter_Transmutation\" title=\"Meta Matter Transmutation\">Meta Matter Transmutation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Matter Manipulation\">Energy Matter Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Omni-Energy Manipulation\">Omni-Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Jasmine (<i>Angel</i>)</li>\n<li>Oryctinis <i>(Ben 10 series)</i></li>\n<li>Kevin Levin (<i>Ben 10 series</i>)</li>\n<li>Aggregor (<i>Ben 10: Ultimate Alien</i>)</li>\n<li>Captain Atom (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Incubus (<i>DC Extended Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>Abzorbaloff (<i>Doctor Who</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Lisa_Pacifist\">Lisa Pacifist</a> (<i>Final Fantasy: Unlimited</i>)</li>\n<li>Homunculi/Father (<i>Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood</i>)</li>\n<li>Galacta (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Galactus (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Silver Surfer (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-682\">SCP-682 - Hard-to-Destroy Reptile</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://kumodesu.fandom.com/wiki/Ariel\">Ariel</a> (<i>So I'm a Spider, So What?</i>)</li>\n<li>Quentin (<i>Sonic: The Blade of Chaos</i>)</li>\n<li>Crystalline Entity (<i>Star Trek: TNG</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Heroes/Paladins Shield (<i>Final Fantasy VI</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergy_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"9bd426238a1bbdfc5173f4aeeaa14d40\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Captain_Atom_2-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:121px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Captain_Atom_2.jpg\" title=\"Captain Atom 2.jpg (302 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:121px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Captain_Atom_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/122?cb=20190220110824\" title=\"Captain Atom 2.jpg (302 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Captain Atom (DC Comics)\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Captain Atom 2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Captain_Atom_2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Captain Atom (DC Comics)\